              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "El Cementerio de la Commonwealth: Un recuerdo solemne"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La cima emocional "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000030",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002f"
              ],
              "text": "del recorrido es la visita al Cementerio"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000031",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " de la Commonwealth."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000032",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000033",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Esta tierra sagrada es el lugar de descanso "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000035",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000034"
              ],
              "text": "de los"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000036",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " soldados de multitud de países que sacrificaron sus vidas en la Segunda Guerra Mundial."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000037",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000038",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El cementerio, con sus hileras de lápidas, se erige como un sombrío y conmovedor homenaje a "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000039"
              ],
              "text": "los"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " que lucharon valientemente."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Es un conmovedor recordatorio del profundo coste humano de la guerra y del perdurable impacto "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000003e"
              ],
              "text": "de estos sacrificios en la historia"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000040",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " global."
            }
          ],
